    description: "Zenodo archive of GateLabR v1.0.0"
abstract: >-
  GateLabR is an R / Shiny application for interactive manual gating of
  mass cytometry (CyTOF) and flow cytometry data stored as
  SingleCellExperiment objects. It supports polygon and rectangle gates,
  Boolean population hierarchies, Cytobank-compatible Gating-ML 2.0
  import / export, FCS export, and Adobe Illustrator-friendly vector SVG
  figure export. Gates, populations and display settings are persisted
  inside the SCE metadata so the entire gating workspace is reloaded
  with the SCE.
